Package: formulaiv
Title: Sensitivity of Formula Instrument to Shock Design
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peizan", "Sheng", , "peizan@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to implement the formula instrument method in
    Borusyak and Hull (2023) <doi:10.3982/ECTA19367> and examine its sensitivity
    to the assumed distributional of counterfactual shocks.
